      "ogDescription": "Vale al portador de 5 pesos de The Sovereign State of Cauca, Popayán, 1882. Colección privada Notofilia.",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colombia/sovereign-state-cauca-5-pesos-1882/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"The Sovereign State of Cauca — Five Pesos (1882)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Colombia catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">United States of Colombia &middot; Popayán &middot; 1882</span>\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">The Sovereign State of Cauca</h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Bearer Voucher &middot; Class B &middot; Five Pesos</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"colombia-estado-soberano-cauca-5-pesos-1882\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-estado-soberano-cauca-5-pesos-1882.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/colombia-estado-soberano-cauca-5-pesos-1882.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Vale al portador de Five Pesos de The Sovereign State of Cauca, obverse arriba con escudo de armas del Cauca y rosetón geométrico con el numeral 5, reverse abajo con el texto de refrendación y firmas\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"498\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Colombia (Sovereign State of Cauca, Popayán)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The Sovereign State of Cauca, one of the nine federal states of the United States of Colombia</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Document Type</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bearer voucher (regional debt instrument, not a banknote)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Five Pesos, Class B</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Paper</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Lithography Paredes &amp; Cía., Bogotá</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Legal Framework</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Law N.&deg; 4 of 1881, admissible for the payment of income and State contributions at a rate of ten percent</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Place and Date of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Popayán, 1882</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatories</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The President of the Superior Court of Justice &middot; The Secretary of the Treasury &middot; The Attorney General of the State &middot; The General Administrator of the Treasury; endorsed by R. M. Arana (President) and M. S. Barreiro (Secretary)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick no.&deg; S142<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup>(S141: 1 Peso &mdash; S143: 10 Pesos, same series of Lithograph Paredes)</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A state within the federation:</strong>Under the Constitution of Rionegro of 1863, the United States of Colombia was organized as a federation of nine sovereign states with broad fiscal autonomy, among them the Sovereign State of Cauca, with capital in Popayán &mdash;each empowered to issue its own vouchers and treasury notes.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Backed by regional law:</strong>This voucher was issued under State Law N.&deg; 4 of 1881, and was admissible in all collection offices for the payment of income and state contributions, in the proportion of ten percent &mdash; a common fiscal mechanism among federal states to finance their treasury without depending on the National Bank.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>coat of arms of the Sovereign State of Cauca on the left; to the right, a circular geometric rosette that frames the numeral &ldquo;5&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Main text:</strong>&ldquo; recognizes to the bearer the sum of FIVE PESOS (without interest), admissible in accordance with article 3.&deg; of law number 4.&deg; of 1881, in all State collection offices, in payment of the rents and contributions established or to be established, in the proportion of ten percent&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Signatures:</strong>four headings corresponding to the President of the Superior Court of Justice, the Secretary of the Treasury, the Attorney General of the State and the General Administrator of the Treasury.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>endorsement text &ldquo;Refrendado por ser auténtico y verdadero&rdquo;, signed by El Presidente (R. M. Arana) and El Secretario (M. S. Barreiro).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Printing:</strong>engraved typography and ornamentation by Litografía Paredes &amp; Cía. of Bogotá, the firm that printed the entire series of vouchers in this issue, from 1 to 10 pesos.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">1. Standard Catalog of World Paper Money (Specialized Issues), designation Pick n.&deg; S142, within the section of issues of sovereign states of Colombia; the vouchers of the same series of Lithography Walls &amp; Cía. range from Pick S141 (1 Peso) to Pick S143 (10 Pesos).</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n     \n     data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button\n        data-zoom-close\n        aria-label=\"Close\"\n        style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n      >&times;</button>\n\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n          disabled=\"true\"\n          aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&minus;</button>\n        <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button\n          disabled=\"false\"\n          data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n      >\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-estado-soberano-cauca-5-pesos-1882.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n          <img data-zoom-image\n            src=\"/uploads/colombia-estado-soberano-cauca-5-pesos-1882.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Vale al portador de The Sovereign State of Cauca, enlarged view\"\n            draggable=\"false\"\n            style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n\n      <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "The Sovereign State of Cauca",
